cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PyModulation in your research or project,
  please cite this software using the information below.

type: software

title: "PyModulation"
abstract: >-
  PyModulation is an open-source Python library that
  implements digital modulation and demodulation
  techniques, with a focus on Software-Defined Radio
  (SDR) applications. It provides a consistent and
  extensible interface for signal processing,
  simulation, prototyping, and experimental
  communication systems.

authors:
